<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-RESULTS IN THE TOUR OF CATALONIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-RESULTS IN THE TOUR OF CATALONIA.</headline>
<dateline>VIC, Spain 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the fifth stage of</p>
<p>the Tour of Spain, a time trial over 22 kms starting and ending</p>
<p>in Vic on Monday:</p>
<p> 1.Chris Boardman (Britain) Gan	    25 minutes 17 seconds</p>
<p> 2.Aitor Garmendia (Spain) ONCE			   46 seconds</p>
<p>behind</p>
<p> 3.Albe Leanizbarrutia (Spain) ONCE		     51</p>
<p> 4.Angel Luis Casero (Spain) Banesto		    58</p>
<p> 5.Mikel Zarrabeitia (Spain) ONCE		     1:07</p>
<p> 6.Bart Voskamp (Holland) TVM			   1:12</p>
<p> 7.Javier Pascual (Spain) Kelme			 1:16</p>
<p> 8.Viatcheslav Djavanian (Russia) Roslotto	  1:21</p>
<p> 9.Fernando Escartin (Spain) Kelme		    1:22</p>
<p> 10.Sergei Ivanov (Russia) TVM			  1:23</p>
<p>Overall standings:</p>
<p> 1.Boardman    14 hours 59 minutes 43 seconds</p>
<p> 2.Casero				 1 minute 10 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3.Leanizbarrutia					   1:24</p>
<p> 4.Escartin						   1:45</p>
<p> 5.Zarrabeitia						1:47</p>
<p> 6.Voskamp						    1:48</p>
<p> 7.Alvaro Gonzalez (Spain) Euskadi		    2:03</p>
<p> 8.Marino Alonso (Spain) Banesto			2:04</p>
<p> 9.Ivanov						     2:06</p>
<p> 10.Pavel Tonkov (Russia) Mapei			 2:07</p>
